     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet contraception-issues-and-concerns-values</b></p><a name=\"contraception-issues-and-concerns-values\"> </a><a name=\"hccontraception-issues-and-concerns-values\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/315604002\">315604002</a></td><td>Missed pills or late injection</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/243818000\">243818000</a></td><td>IUD concerns</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/169489007\">169489007</a></td><td>IUD partial expulsion</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/169487009\">169487009</a></td><td>IUD complete expulsion</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/14302001\">14302001</a></td><td>Amenorrhoea</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/301822002\">301822002</a></td><td>Irregular bleeding</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/9126005\">9126005</a></td><td>Spotting or light bleeding</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/44991000119100\">44991000119100</a></td><td>Change in timing of monthly bleeding</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/289539007\">289539007</a></td><td>Heavy or prolonged bleeding</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/289530006\">289530006</a></td><td>Unexplained vaginal bleeding</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/48079002\">48079002</a></td><td>Mood changes after start of method</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/365965002\">365965002</a></td><td>Changes in sex drive</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/247347003\">247347003</a></td><td>Discomfort or pain with use</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/12243431000119101\">12243431000119101</a></td><td>Abscess</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/72934000\">72934000</a></td><td>Candidiasis</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/419760006\">419760006</a></td><td>Bacterial vaginosis</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/18504008\">18504008</a></td><td>Toxic shock syndrome</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/68566005\">68566005</a></td><td>Urinary tract infection</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/55607006\">55607006</a></td><td>Difficulty inserting/removing/using method</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/74964007\">74964007</a></td><td>Other</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/11381005\">11381005</a></td><td>Acne</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/365921005\">365921005</a></td><td>Weight change</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/53430007\">53430007</a></td><td>Breast tenderness</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/422587007\">422587007</a></td><td>Nausea</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/404640003\">404640003</a></td><td>Dizziness</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 2019-covid-expanded has been used\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\"> version ⏿2019-covid-expanded</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N91.462\">N91.2</a></td><td>Amenorrhoea</td><td>Amenorrhoea, unspecified</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N93.469\">N93.9</a></td><td>Irregular bleeding</td><td>Abnormal uterine and vaginal bleeding, unspecified</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-Z32.460\">Z32.0</a></td><td>Client suspects pregnancy</td><td>Pregnancy, not (yet) confirmed</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N89.468\">N89.8</a></td><td>Spotting or light bleeding / Unexplained vaginal bleeding</td><td>Other specified noninflammatory disorders of vagina</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N93\">N93</a></td><td>Heavy or prolonged bleeding</td><td>Other abnormal uterine and vaginal bleeding</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-F39\">F39</a></td><td>Mood changes after start of method</td><td>Unspecified mood [affective] disorder</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N99.4689\">N99.89</a></td><td>Pain lasting for months</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-R10.4630\">R10.30</a></td><td>Severe pain in lower abdomen</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-T81.464\">T81.4</a></td><td>Abscess</td><td>Infection following a procedure, not elsewhere classified</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-B37.463\">B37.3</a></td><td>Candidiasis</td><td>Candidiasis of vulva and vagina[N77.1]</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N76.460\">N76.0</a></td><td>Bacterial vaginosis</td><td>Acute vaginitis</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/CodeSystem/tx-icd10-2019#tx-icd10-2019-N77.461\">N77.1</a></td><td>Bacterial vaginosis</td><td>Vaginitis, vulvitis and vulvovaginitis in infectious and parasitic diseases classified elsewhere</td></tr